B.LR=new A.c5("It was the busiest day at the North Pole workshop. Pip the elf was in charge of the gift tags, and he was very proud of the job.","story_workshop","char_elf",B.X)
B.M5=new A.c5("Oh no! Pip put the tags on the wrong boxes. The bike had a tag for a teddy bear, and the drum had a tag for a puzzle!","story_workshop","char_elf",B.X)
B.LY=new A.c5('Pip felt terrible. "I made a big mix-up, and the sleigh leaves tonight," he told Santa. His ears drooped.',"story_workshop","char_elf",B.X)
B.M2=new A.c5('"Everyone makes mistakes," said Santa with a smile. "Let us fix it together. Ask your friends for help." Pip rang the workshop bell.',"story_workshop","char_santa",B.X)
B.LZ=new A.c5("Elves came running from every corner. One read the names, one checked the lists, and one peeled off old tags. Pip stuck on the right ones.","story_workshop","char_elf",B.X)
B.LP=new A.c5("Just in time, every gift had the right tag. The sleigh flew over the snowy village, and Pip learned that a mistake is easy to fix with friends.","story_village","char_elf",B.X)
